{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42446","headline":"送德林郎中学士赴东府 · 乔舜","name":"送德林郎中学士赴东府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掺袂向江头，朝宗势未休。\n何人乘桂楫，之子过扬州。\n飒飒翘沙鴈，漂漂逐浪鸥。\n欲知离别恨，半是泪和流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔舜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}